<Base title="Track your order" current="track">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <div class="page-title"><h1 class="display h2">Track your order</h1></div>
    <p>Every order confirmation email has a private <strong>“View your order status”</strong> link. Open it to see whether your order is confirmed, packed, shipped or delivered, and the courier tracking number once it ships.</p>
    <p>For your privacy, orders can only be opened with that link — not by order number alone.</p>
    <h2>Can't find the email?</h2>
    <p>Check your spam folder, or call us with your order number (it looks like VK-1042):</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="tel:+919600577555">Call +91 96005 77555</a> <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://wa.me/919600686606" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WhatsApp us</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
